<title>USA: Cardiovascular names O'Donnell president.</title>
<headline>Cardiovascular names O'Donnell president.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CardioVascular Dynamics Inc said Jeffrey O'Donnell was named president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Since joining the firm in November 1995, he has been CVD vice-president of sales and marketing.</p>
<p>Michael Henson will continue in his current position as chairman and chief executive officer of CardioVascular.</p>
<p>The company develops and markets coronary stents, stent delivery systems, balloon dilatation catheters, vascular access products and minimally invasive devices for peripheral vascular applications.</p>
</text>
